      "writtenOn": "2024-03-27T09:38:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we accept FIREWALL_CHAIN_BACKGROUND only on V+ release?\nFIREWALL_CHAIN_BACKGROUND is part of sdk extension so technically U- release can call setFirewallChainEnabled with FIREWALL_CHAIN_BACKGROUND, I think.",
